# Selected Qa/SU3 Strominger HYM Source Packet Search v1

## Purpose

This searches for the missing same-branch source packet:

```text
selected Qa/SU3 compact Nil/Iwasawa color bundle, sheaf, or twist
+ Chern/Bianchi/gerbe data
+ connection or HYM/Strominger residual
+ endomorphism_E or determinant finite part.
```

## Result

The search finds two strong templates, but not the needed source:

```text
general Strominger/HYM fixed-sector template: found
visible-sector source-packet analogue: found
same-branch Qa/SU3 source packet: not found
```

The Strominger corpus supplies fixed topological sectors, HYM/Bianchi equations,
positive Hessian language, and invariant Iwasawa/Fu-Yau templates.  The visible
branch supplies the correct packet shape: selected source, Chern-Weil row,
Bianchi/Freed-Witten checks, and operator-source gates.

Neither names a selected Qa/SU3 compact Nil/Iwasawa color-threshold source.

## Required Source Packet

The missing object must contain:

```text
branch: compact Nil/Iwasawa Qa sector,
source certificate selecting the SU3 color bundle/sheaf/twist,
Chern/Mukai/gerbe data on that branch,
Bianchi or Freed-Witten/anomaly check on that branch,
connection or HYM/Strominger residual data,
operator domain compatible with p0 and p!=0 quotient rules,
endomorphism_E or equivalent heat-kernel zero-order block,
one finite-part computation: heat coefficients, spectrum, or torsion,
trace normalization and gauge quotient scheme.
```

## Decision

Generic Strominger/HYM existence is not enough.  The next step is to construct
candidate Chern/Bianchi source packets on compact Nil/Iwasawa:

```text
Selected_Qa_SU3_Chern_Bianchi_Source_Packet_Candidates_v1
